{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 4, :comments ["<b>And he said.</b> The word תפריעו is like שבוש, and its parallel is באין חזון יפרע עם (Proverbs 29:18). Included in the word לכו לסבלותיכם are Moses and Aaron, for they stand for all Israel, because סבלותיכם is not like עסקיכם, and the witness is \"והשבתם אותם מסבלותם\" (Exodus 1 [=chapter] 5)."], :book :exodus, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 5, :notes {0 "The verse citation פ׳ ה likely refers to Exodus chapter 1 (parashat Shemot), where מסבלותם appears at Exodus 1:11; Ibn Ezra's chapter numbering convention is not fully certain here."}, :source-witnesses [["Piotrkow, 1907-1911" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH990020973480205171/NLI"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:31:49.825185536Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}